## Payment Flow

```
User initiates payment (/payment)
    ↓
Check eligibility (can_pay, already premium, has subscription)
    ↓
If eligible: Show payment instructions
    ↓
User uploads screenshot
    ↓
Save payment record with pending status
    ↓
Admin reviews (views screenshot inline)
    ↓
Admin approves/rejects with reason
    ↓
If approved: Grant lifetime premium (is_premium = True)
    ↓
Notify user of result
```

---

## Safe Attribute Access Pattern

All code uses safe attribute access to handle missing columns:

```python
# Before (may crash):
sub_days = payment.subscription_days

# After (safe):
sub_days = getattr(payment, 'subscription_days', None)
sub_text = f"{sub_days} days" if sub_days else "Lifetime"
```

---

## Error Handling

All handlers catch exceptions and display user-friendly messages:

| Error Case | Message |
|------------|---------|
| Already premium | "✅ You've already unlocked full access!" |
| Has active subscription | "📅 You already have an active subscription!" |
| Pending payment exists | "⏳ Payment Already Pending" |
| User not found | "❌ User account not found" |
| Screenshot processing failed | "❌ Failed to process screenshot" |

